> +experimental.

I meant +exp, of course.

> I propose instead classifying cmavo as follows:
> I. cmavo assigned a selmaho and meaning in official documentation
> II. cmavo assigned a selmaho in official documentation but not a
> meaning
> III. cmavo assigned a selmaho and meaning in currently unofficial
> documentation
> IV. cmavo not assigned a selmaho or meaning in any current
